70","kind":"announcement","title":"Sombie is coming to Early Access on October 30","summary":"Sombie launches into Early Access on Friday, October 30. Thanks to everyone who played the demo during Next Fest. Your feedback and bug reports helped a lot. What's in the game Sombie is an always-online zombie survival MMO in a big, randomly generated world of towns, forests, rivers and lakes. Team up with other players, or shoot them and take their loot. [*]Raid houses, shops and hospitals for food, weapons and ammo. Zombies can hear and see you, so keep quiet and stay out of the dark. [*]Cut ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044373","verified_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3651370-1797185861616420","game_id":"steam-3651370","kind":"announcement","title":"Real time shadows","summary":"WOWSERS PRETTY ːsteamhappyː {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45577081/673989e2840995c1e2d1f1b879ad1accaea61663.gif We have been working on the new lighting system for months. Now all trees in the game will react to your flashlight (or any light source) Performance GTX 1080 @1080p = 70fps in a worst case scenario with two players running around casting lights at different angles with multiple trees. 7800 XT @1440p = 130 fps in the same scenario. Disappointed in these numbers? we are too. Performance will be im","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-16T20:23:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1797185861616420","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3651370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:52Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:51Z","error